  616|    705|    // Insane framerates or frame sizes mean insane bitrates.
  617|    705|    // Let's not get carried away.
  618|    705|    // We also subtract 16 bits from each temporal unit to account for the
  619|    705|    //  temporal delimiter, whose bits are not included in the frame sizes
  620|    705|    //  reported to update_state().
